-{"species":"archaludon","moves":["aurasphere","dracometeor","electroshot","flashcannon"],"item":"choicescarf","regulation":"champions-reg-mb","spread":{"hp":2,"atk":0,"def":0,"spa":32,"spd":0,"spe":32},"source_tier":"champions_native_writeup","verified":false,"verification_context":{},"date_resolved":"2026-07-27T18:38:52Z","variants":[{"hp":32,"atk":0,"def":11,"spa":15,"spd":0,"spe":8}],"rationale":"When paired with a rain setter like Pelipper, Archaludon can build dangerous offensive momentum with Electro Shot. Electro Shot : Thanks to the Special Attack boost, even the first Electro Shot used can be difficult to switch into without an Electric resistance, and it can also OHKO frailer targets like Mega Lucario. Draco Meteor : Electro Shot may be the star of the show, but Draco Meteor is often Archaludon's best option when you're trying to play around Ground-type switch-ins such as Garchomp. Aura Sphere: Aura Sphere provides consistent coverage independent from the weather, pressuring Dark-types like Kingambit and opposing Archaludon. Thunderbolt: Thunderbolt is an alternative Electric-type option to use outside of rain, which can be especially relevant for keeping pressure on Mega Charizard Y. SP Spreads and Items 2 HP / 32 SpA / 32 Spe with Timid: A standard offensive spread for use with Choice Scarf. A Timid nature is mandatory, as Archaludon wants to outrun Choice Scarf Jolly Basculegion-M. 32 HP / 11 Def / 15 SpA / 8 Spe with Modest: Going with a bulkier spread along with a Sitrus Berry sacrifices immediate offensive pressure, but it eases the need for prediction and allows Archaludon more flexibility in and out of rain. Enough Special Attack investment is maintained to guarantee that Electro Shot OHKOes offensive Mega Gyarados, and the Speed investment is enough to outrun fully invested base 60s like Primarina. The remaining SPs go into HP and Defense, giving Archaludon a decent chance of avoiding the 2HKO from Jolly Garchomp's Earthquake after Sitrus Berry healing and a Stamina activiation.","source_format":"champions/battle-stadium-singles"}
